From: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: strparser: make STREAM_PARSER user-selectable

Allow STREAM_PARSER to be explicitly selected by out-of-tree modules
or OpenWrt package configuration instead of relying on internal kernel
reverse dependencies like AF_KCM.

Signed-off-by: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
---
--- a/net/strparser/Kconfig
+++ b/net/strparser/Kconfig
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 config STREAM_PARSER
-	def_bool n
+	tristate "Stream parser support"
+	default n
